A common way to make unholy water is the opposite of how to make
holy water.  Since this deletes any gifted protection, it is a
BAD idea for you at this point.  I usually check all potions for
BUC status and any cursed potion of a type that can be converted
to water with a unihorn I'll do that.  Also hoard every unholy
water you encounter until you have enough uncursed waters to dip
it into.  By the end of the game you'll want a handfull of potions
of unholy water for purposes like yours.

